-</style><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Enter the price and the rent. The calculator takes out the tax a rental pays in that town, the HOA dues, insurance, management, and repairs and empty months. It opens on the Carolina Forest house in the sheet below.</p><div class="rnc" id="rnc"><div class="rnc-ex" role="group" aria-label="Load one of the three example homes"><span>Load an example:</span><button type="button" onclick="rncEx(0)" aria-pressed="true">Carolina Forest house</button><button type="button" onclick="rncEx(1)" aria-pressed="false">Longs house</button><button type="button" onclick="rncEx(2)" aria-pressed="false">Myrtle Beach condo</button></div><div class="rnc-grid"><div><fieldset><legend>The home</legend><div class="rnc-fields"><label class="rnc-f w" for="rncZip">Area and ZIP code<select id="rncZip" onchange="rncZip()"><option value="29579" selected>Carolina Forest (29579)</option><option value="29568">Longs (29568)</option><option value="29577">Myrtle Beach (29577)</option><option value="29572">Myrtle Beach, north end (29572)</option><option value="29582">North Myrtle Beach (29582)</option><option value="29588">Socastee (29588)</option><option value="29566">Little River (29566)</option><option value="29576">Murrells Inlet and Garden City (29576)</option><option value="29575">Surfside Beach (29575)</option><option value="29526">Conway (29526)</option><option value="29527">Conway (29527)</option><option value="29569">Loris (29569)</option><option value="29511">Aynor (29511)</option></select></label><label class="rnc-f" for="rncBeds">Bedrooms<select id="rncBeds" onchange="rncZip()"><option value="2">2</option><option value="3" selected>3</option><option value="4">4 or more</option></select></label><label class="rnc-f" for="rncRent">Rent a month<span class="rnc-box"><span aria-hidden="true">$</span><input id="rncRent" type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" step="10" value="2230" oninput="rncCalc()"></span></label><label class="rnc-f w" for="rncPrice">Asking price<span class="rnc-box"><span aria-hidden="true">$</span><input id="rncPrice" type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" step="1000" value="390000" oninput="rncCalc()"></span></label></div><p class="rnc-hint" id="rncRentNote"></p></fieldset><fieldset><legend>The costs</legend><div class="rnc-fields"><label class="rnc-f w" for="rncTax">Where it is taxed<select id="rncTax" onchange="rncCalc()"><option value="201.0" selected>Outside city limits</option><option value="207.3">Murrells Inlet or Garden City, outside city limits</option><option value="214.2">Inside Surfside Beach</option><option value="221.2">Inside North Myrtle Beach</option><option value="254.6">Inside the City of Myrtle Beach</option><option value="272.5">Inside Conway</option><option value="282.2">Inside Loris</option></select></label><label class="rnc-f" for="rncDues">HOA dues a month<span class="rnc-box"><span aria-hidden="true">$</span><input id="rncDues" type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" step="5" value="100" oninput="rncCalc()"></span></label><label class="rnc-f" for="rncIns">Insurance a year<span class="rnc-box"><span aria-hidden="true">$</span><input id="rncIns" type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" step="50" value="0" oninput="rncCalc()"></span></label><label class="rnc-f" for="rncMgmt">Management, share of rent<span class="rnc-box"><input id="rncMgmt" type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" step="1" value="10" oninput="rncCalc()"><span aria-hidden="true">%</span></span></label><label class="rnc-f" for="rncRep">Repairs and empty months<span class="rnc-box"><input id="rncRep" type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="0" step="1" value="10" oninput="rncCalc()"><span aria-hidden="true">%</span></span></label></div><p class="rnc-hint">The town rate is set from the ZIP code. A ZIP code can cross city limits, so pick the home's own town. Type your insurance quote.</p></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Your loan, if you use one</legend><div c